#: src/polyx/gui/detector/pages/report.py:36
msgid ""
"Generates a self-contained HTML report (every image embedded as base64, so nothing breaks when "
"you send it to someone else) with methods, metrics, charts, a comparison gallery, per-sample "
"counts and error analysis. You can export it straight to PDF to send it, or save each photo "
"separately with its labels drawn on."
msgstr ""

